        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Louis Leterrier, Corey Yuen, Luc Besson\n- Films: The Transporter, Unleashed, The Incredible Hulk, Clash of the Titans, Now You See Me, The Hire\n- Roles: film director, artistic director\n\nFacts:\n- Louis Leterrier was born on June 17, 1973.\n- Louis Leterrier is a French film director.\n- The Transporter is a 2002 English-language French action thriller film.\n- The Transporter was directed by Corey Yuen and Louis Leterrier, and Louis Leterrier was credited on the project as artistic director.\n- The Transporter was written by Luc Besson.\n- Luc Besson was inspired by BMW Films' The Hire series when writing The Transporter.\n- Louis Leterrier's films include the first two Transporter films, Unleashed (2005), The Incredible Hulk (2008), Clash of the Titans (2010), and Now You See Me (2013).",
